    "sections": {
        "description": "MoreBlog is a fast, modern, and highly customizable WordPress theme designed for news, magazine, blog, and editorial websites that demand performance, flexibility, and style. With 100+ ready-to-import starter sites for Gutenberg and Elementor, 9+ custom widgets, multiple homepage post banner layouts, archive and single post options, sticky headers, and light/dark reading modes, it lets you build a professional site without coding. Fully responsive and mobile-first, MoreBlog is optimized for SEO, Core Web Vitals, and accessibility (WCAG-ready), ensuring top performance across all devices. It supports multilingual and RTL languages, integrates seamlessly with WooCommerce for online stores, and is compatible with popular plugins like Jetpack, Contact Form 7, and Yoast SEO. One-click demo import, live customizer controls, and a clean, lightweight codebase make MoreBlog the perfect choice for publishers, bloggers, and businesses looking to launch a stylish, fast, and future-proof website. Explore all features at https://afthemes.com/products/moreblog/."
    },
